Krypton: local, sandboxed page translation without remote services.
Register the owned provider before profiles, replace the component installer on
Windows, and default the existing provider feature on. Pass the document's
BrowserContext additively to preserve profile isolation. Disable the web-facing
Translator API by default. Fix the compatibility client's output callback to
write to its output buffer rather than mutate a const input reference.
No inference or page text is sent to a server; pack downloads need a host action.

